{
  "tools": {
    "wps_ppt_set_shape_gradient": {
      "description": "设置幻灯片中指定形状的渐变填充效果。\n\ngradient对象属性：\n- type: 渐变类型，\"linear\"(线性) 或 \"radial\"(径向)\n- angle: 渐变角度（0-360，仅线性渐变）\n- stops: 渐变色标数组 [{color: \"#FF0000\", position: 0}, {color: \"#0000FF\", position: 1}]\n\n使用场景：\n- \"给形状加渐变色\"\n- \"设置从红到蓝的渐变\"",
      "maps_to": "wps_ppt_set_shape_gradient",
      "server": "wps-office",
      "inputSchema": {
        "properties": {
          "gradient": {
            "description": "渐变配置对象",
            "properties": {
              "angle": {
                "description": "渐变角度（0-360）",
                "type": "number"
              },
              "stops": {
                "description": "渐变色标数组",
                "items": {
                  "properties": {
                    "color": {
                      "description": "颜色值",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "position": {
                      "description": "位置 (0-1)",
                      "type": "number"
                    }
                  },
                  "type": "object"
                },
                "type": "array"
              },
              "type": {
                "description": "渐变类型: linear 或 radial",
                "enum": [
                  "linear",
                  "radial"
                ],
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "type": "object"
          },
          "shapeIndex": {
            "description": "形状索引（从1开始）",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "slideIndex": {
            "description": "幻灯片页码（从1开始）",
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "slideIndex",
          "shapeIndex",
          "gradient"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      }
    }
  }
}
